Nethack 3.0i7, Mac, binaries from apple.com:

One of my better games, at level 23 so far, lots of intrinsics...

Then I realized I haven't encountered *any* treasure zoos or throne
rooms; haven't gone through the 'rogue' level; and haven't gone
through an 'undead' level (lots of wraiths, vampires, and ghosts).
I've encountered these in every other game in version 3.0*.

But, apparently to make up for the lack of these special rooms, I have
encountered to others.  The first is a swamp (lots of water and
molds)--I've never seen one of these in hundreds of games.  Is this a
new feature?  The second is a platoon of soldiers, i.e. is roomful of
soldiers, not just a small group wandering around.  Used to find those
every game in 2.3, but this is the first one I've found in 3.0*.

I'm not complaining--the variety is kind of nice.  Just curious as to
how often this happens.

